    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a bonus action, you can attempt to exhaust a creature you can see within 30 feet of you. The target must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or have their speed be reduced to 0 and they can’t use reactions until the end of your next turn.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> This curse lasts for 1 minute. At the end of each of its turns, the cursed creature can make another Constitution saving throw. On a success, this curse ends.</p>",
